# TripleTen – Statistical Data Analysis

## Project Overview

This repository contains my work completed during Sprint 4 of the TripleTen Data Analytics Bootcamp.

During this sprint, I learned the fundamentals of statistical data analysis. I explored descriptive statistics, probability theory, and hypothesis testing to make data-driven decisions and validate business assumptions using real datasets.

## Topics Covered

- Descriptive Statistics
- Probability Theory
- Hypothesis Testing
- Statistical Analysis
- Business Case Study

## Tools

- Python
- Pandas
- NumPy
- SciPy
- Jupyter Notebook

## Skills Developed

- Calculating descriptive statistics
- Understanding probability concepts
- Performing hypothesis tests
- Interpreting p-values and statistical significance
- Drawing conclusions based on data
- Supporting business decisions with statistical analysis
